Grain-Growth Chunking
Copyright 2026 Mudit Choudhary

Structure-aware document chunking: chunks grow along a document's own grain and
never cross a structural barrier.

Developed and evaluated in the Anneal project. The method and its measured
results are described in:
https://github.com/muditchoudhary/anneal/blob/main/evals/Reports/Report.md

